From: Kostiantyn Andriiuk <konstantin@andriyuk.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Adapt KG-SSTV and weather modules to the current DSP API

Base: SDR++ 8c9f5ee8fe405775bfcd62c8c8f8c0fc928a64af

Update the existing KG-SSTV and weather modules without changing their
upstream author notices. The weather-deframing.h, weather-noaa-hrpt.h
and weather-noaa-tip.h files adapt AlexandreRouma's earlier SDR++ code:
https://github.com/AlexandreRouma/SDRPlusPlus/tree/6f747dad0d28964cb79e245c1069b165b0deaa54/core/src/dsp

Local compatibility changes are by Kostiantyn Andriiuk. The restored
NOAA/DSP implementations and the original modules are upstream work.
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only

